/name></person-group><article-title>Counting the dead and what they died from: an assessment of the global status of cause of death data</article-title><source>Bull World Health Org</source><year>2005</year><volume>83</volume><fpage>171</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15798840</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Hemed</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Adult morbidity and Mortality Project (AMMP): Volume 1. A ten-year community perspective. The policy implications of Tanzania's mortality burden</article-title><publisher-name>Dar es Salaam, Ministry of Health, Tanzania, University of Newcastle upon Tyne</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="b11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="other"><collab>Ifakara Health Research</collab><article-title>The Ifakara Demographic Surveillance site</article-title><comment><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.idrc.ca/en/ev-43013-201-1-DO_TOPIC.html">http://www.idrc.ca/en/ev-43013-201-1-DO_TOPIC.html</ext-link>URL Accessed</comment></citation></ref><ref id="b12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="other"><collab>Women's Dignity Project and Ifakara Health Research and Development Centre</collab><article-title>Fairs Fair. Health Inequalities and Equity in Tanzania</article-title><comment><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.womensdignity.org">http://www.womensdignity.org</ext-link><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ihrdc.org">http://www.ihrdc.org</ext-link>URL</comment></citation></ref><ref id="b13"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Warsame</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Recognition, Perception and Treatment Practices for Severe Malaria in Rural Tanzania. Implications for Accessing Rectal A